   "path": "inv_control/invcontrol_multi_vv_wye.dss",
   "kind": "micro",
   "n_steps": 1,
   "selected_elements": [
    "*"
   ],
   "compare_eventlog": true,
   "oracle": "capi015",
   "note": "WP-U1.3 / ledger L1 (InvControlDeltaV per-control 2-slot buffer). TWO InvControls on separate wye PVSystems, VOLTVAR with hysteresis_offset=-0.05 -> voltagechangesolution drives the curve-1/2 hysteresis state machine. Feature-sensitive: on the 0.15.x fix (capi015==Rust) both controls advance their own FVpuSolutionIdx and settle; the 9-year EPRI bug (r4133) leaves the 2nd control's index stuck so pv2 kvar oscillates (probe scratch_probe_l1.py). Gated capi015; per-step pv1/pv2 kvar (full-model) + event log exact."
  },
  {
   "path": "inv_control/invcontrol_vv_delta.dss",
